tified that he shot at  McDonald's knife until he dropped it but  Gleeson rejected that explanation you're  not trained as a police officer to shoot  at somebody's knife are you no you're  not  McDonald's death led to massive protests  and political action including the  firing of the city's police  superintendent and on Tuesday Chicago's  Civil Rights icon the Reverend Jesse  Jackson demanded justice justice and  peace go hand in hand and the once  there's no justice no peace there must  be a some mass action if justice is not  printed  defense attorneys may wrap up their case  this morning and closing arguments are  expected later this week Viana dean  thank you
 

